{"t":"PPL","n":"PPL Corporation","nKo":"PPL","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":35.2,"chg":0.55,"chgPct":0.01587,"prev":34.65,"dayH":35.27,"dayL":34.61,"w52H":40.11,"w52L":31.56,"vol":7900694,"avgVol":7849540,"mcap":26496724992,"pe":20.23,"fpe":16.62,"eps":1.74,"feps":2.12,"pb":1.74,"div":1.14,"divY":0.0324,"beta":0.56,"short":34421816,"shortPct":0.0524,"shortRatio":4.85,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Utilities","sKo":"유용","i":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","iKo":"유틸리티 - 규제 전기","city":"Allentown","emp":6546,"web":"https://www.pplweb.com","sum":"PPL Corporation provides electricity and natural gas to approximately 3.6 million customers in the United States. It operates in three segments: Kentucky Regulated, Pennsylvania Regulated, and Rhode Island Regulated. The company engages in the transmission and distribution of electricity in eastern and central Pennsylvania; generation, transmission, distribution, and sale of electricity in Kentucky, Virginia, and Rhode Island; distribution and sale of natural gas in Kentucky and Rhode Island; sale of wholesale electricity in Kentucky; and generation of electricity from power plants in Kentucky. It generates electricity from coal, gas, hydro, and solar sources. The company was formerly known as PP&L Resources, Inc. and changed its name to PPL Corporation in 2000. PPL Corporation was founded","sumKo":"PPL Corporation은 미국 내 약 360만 고객에게 전기와 천연가스를 공급합니다. 켄터키 규제, 펜실베니아 규제, 로드아일랜드 규제의 세 부분으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 펜실베니아 동부 및 중부 지역에서 전력 송전 및 배전을 담당하고 있습니다. 켄터키, 버지니아, 로드 아일랜드의 전력 생산, 송전, 배전 및 판매; 켄터키와 로드아일랜드의 천연가스 유통 및 판매; 켄터키의 도매 전기 판매; 켄터키주 발전소에서 전력 생산. 석탄, 가스, 수력, 태양광 발전을 통해 전기를 생산합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 PP&L Resources, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2000년에 PPL Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. PPL Corporation이 설립되었습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":7902000000,"ni":756000000},{"y":2023,"rev":8312000000,"ni":740000000},{"y":2024,"rev":8462000000,"ni":888000000},{"y":2025,"rev":9042000000,"ni":1181000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2274000000,"ni":266000000}